  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your ability to use rituals has grown to great power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spell Dabbler, spherecaster</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using your Spell Dabbler feat, you may increase the preparation time to 1 hour to prepare as many rituals as you desire, spending spell points for each prepared ritual. You cannot prepare more than 4 rituals of any individual level in this manner.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ritual-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
